        "formDataValid": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "agent_rocketride_2",
      "provider": "agent_rocketride",
      "config": {
        "agent_description": "Relay code editor. Given a plan from the resume reasoner, writes the patch in the target repository, runs the test suite, retries up to three times on failure, opens the pull request, and writes the agent-authored Step/Decision nodes back to the memory graph.",
        "instructions": [
          "You are invoked as a tool by the resume reasoner. Your input is a plan, a list of target files, and the current failing-test signal.",
          "CodeEdit: use the GitHub tool to read the current file contents, then write the smallest patch that implements the plan on branch 'relay/resume-${ROCKETRIDE_TARGET_TASK_ID}'.",
          "TestRunner: use the Python tool to run `npm test` with cwd `demo/toy-repo` (the command frozen in demo/scenario.json) and capture the real output. The known failure is the token-bucket limiter not refilling at exactly 1000 ms. Never report a test result you did not observe.",
          "Retry loop: if tests fail, revise the patch and re-run. Make at most three attempts total, then stop and report the failure with the last test output.",
          "OpenPR: only after a green test run, open a pull request via the GitHub tool. The PR body must state what was inherited from the previous session, what you changed, which tests ran, and how many attempts it took.",
          "F6 write-back: use the write-enabled FalkorDB tool to MERGE the work you did back into the per-task graph as agent-authored nodes: MERGE (a:Agent {id:'relay-code-editor'}); MERGE (st:Step {id:$step_id}) SET st.author='agent', st.description=$description, st.status=$status; MERGE (d:Decision {id:$decision_id}) SET d.author='agent', d.text=$text, d.reasoning=$reasoning; MERGE (d)-[:MADE_DURING]->(st); MERGE (t:Task {id:$task_id})-[:RESUMED_BY]->(a). Always MERGE, never CREATE, so replay stays idempotent.",
          "Return a structured report: { patched_files, attempts, tests_passed, pr_url, graph_nodes_written }."
        ],
        "max_waves": 10,
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "control": [
        {
          "classType": "tool",
          "from": "agent_rocketride_1"
        }
      ],
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 870,
          "y": 380
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 150,
          "height": 86
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      }
    },
